data: {"id": "deaa952f329f4a2a-thinking-parallel_evidence-1092", "run_id": "deaa952f329f4a2a", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 2. 证据汇总与根因分析\n\n### 2.1 已确认事实\n\n1.  **Pod 生命周期状态**：\n    *   Pod `aiops-case-v05/workload` UID 为 `b9e687f5-702b-4d01-bfb9-2df4ff23ba91`，调度在 `node2`。\n    *   状态为 `Pending`，容器 `app` 处于 `Waiting`，状态原因为 `ContainerCreating`。\n    *   Metrics 确认 `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 值为 1 (reason=ContainerCreating)。\n    *   `containerStatuses.app` 中 `restarts=0`，表示容器自创建以来未发生重启。\n\n2.  **Pod 配置结构**：\n    *   Pod 包含一个容器 `app`，镜像为 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`。\n    *   **Volumes**：", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789123737454, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

