data: {"id": "deaa952f329f4a2a-final", "run_id": "deaa952f329f4a2a", "seq": 1097, "ts_ms": 1789123755232, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v05/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-v05/workload 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态，无法启动应用容器 app。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubelet (fact-31ffcf2d33e6) | `Warning FailedMount... configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key` (117s 内发生 23 次) | 确认卷挂载失败的根本原因是 ConfigMap 引用了不存在的 key |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubelet (fact-401c331b0947) | `Warning FailedMount... timed out waiting for the condition` (10m 内发生 10 次) | 证实挂载操作因上游校验失败而持续超时 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Pod/Container (fact-0f546153a17b) | `pod.status: Pending` | 显示 Pod 当前处于挂起状态 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Container (fact-b381c3474aae) | `container.waiting_reason: ContainerCreating` | 显示容器卡在初始化阶段，未进入运行态 |\n| 5 | K8s Config | Container (fact-12556ef2e248) | `container.resource_limit.memory: 32Mi` | 提供运行资源上下文，排除资源不足作为直接原因 |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus (fact-2617aabba362) | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1 (label: reason=\"ContainerCreating\") | 监控指标确认容器等待状态，与事件日志一致 |\n\n证据 1 (FailedMount) 和 证据 2 (Timed Out) 互相印证，明确指出挂载卷 `input` 因 ConfigMap key 缺失而失败，直接导致了 证据 3 (Pending) 和 证据 4 (ContainerCreating) 所呈现的 Pod 状态停滞。监控数据 (证据 6) 在宏观层面复现了该异常状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'workload-input' 不存在 key 'unavailable-key' → kubelet 卷挂载校验失败 (FailedMount) → MountVolume.SetUp 失败且超时 → Pod 处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态，无法启动应用\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因**：Pod 的 `volume 'input'` 挂载了 ConfigMap `workload-input`，但该 ConfigMap 中不存在 Spec 中引用的 key `unavailable-key` (证据 1)。这导致 kubelet 在初始化卷挂载时校验失败 (证据 2)，进而使 Pod 无法完成初始化，始终停留在 `ContainerCreating` 状态 (证据 3, 4)。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 20.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 43.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v05/workload: 43.9s (Evidence 35.3s, RCA 8.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v05/workload**: pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 73.864, "metrics": {"run_id": "deaa952f329f4a2a", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 73.8699324131012, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "45%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 73869.9324131012, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 63905.94005584717, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 13, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 14, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 17188.617706298828, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 9403.09596061